~~ =====================================================================
~~  SPRFST Shield — the block list
~~
~~  Plain text, one rule per line. The syntax is described at the top of
~~  src/shield.spf; the short of it:
~~
~~      ||host^            the host and everything under it
~~      ||host/path        a host together with a path
~~      /anywhere/         a piece of any address
~~      |http://start      the address begins like this
~~      .gif|              the address ends like this
~~      @@||host^          an exception, checked before anything else
~~      ||host^$third-party   only away from the site you are reading
~~      ##.selector        hide these elements on every site
~~      site.com##.promo   hide these elements on one site
~~      ~~ or !            a comment
~~
~~  Edit this file and reopen the browser; the count on sprfst://shield
~~  tells you how many rules were understood.
~~ =====================================================================

